      <link>https://www.aajtak.in/auto/news/story/cng-car-explodes-during-refuelling-gujarat-key-safety-checks-tips-auam-dskc-2660275-2026-10-03?utm_source=rssfeed</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">rss-src_aajtak_rss-Q05HIOCkreCksO</guid>
