      <source url="https://www.aajtak.in/auto/news/story/cng-car-explodes-during-refuelling-gujarat-key-safety-checks-tips-auam-dskc-2660275-2026-10-03?utm_source=rssfeed">आज तक (Aaj Tak Hindi News)</source>
